		<string>PneumaGe needs Bluetooth to connect to the accumulation chamber device for real-time gas measurements.</string>
		<key>NSBluetoothPeripheralUsageDescription</key>
		<string>PneumaGe needs Bluetooth to connect to the accumulation chamber device for real-time gas measurements.</string>
		<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
		<string>PneumaGe needs your location to tag measurement sites with GPS coordinates for accurate flux mapping.</string>
		<key>UIViewControllerBasedStatusBarAppearance</key>
		<false/>
